{"words": [{"text": "فَهَزَمُوهُم", "translation": "So they defeated them"}, {"text": "بِإِذْنِ", "translation": "by (the) permission"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "وَقَتَلَ", "translation": "and killed"}, {"text": "دَاوُۥدُ", "translation": "Dawood"}, {"text": "جَالُوتَ", "translation": "Jalut"}, {"text": "وَءَاتَىٰهُ", "translation": "and gave him"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُلْكَ", "translation": "the kingdom"}, {"text": "وَٱلْحِكْمَةَ", "translation": "and the wisdom"}, {"text": "وَعَلَّمَهُۥ", "translation": "and taught him"}, {"text": "مِمَّا", "translation": "that which"}, {"text": "يَشَآءُ ۗ", "translation": "He willed"}, {"text": "وَلَوْلَا", "translation": "And if not"}, {"text": "دَفْعُ", "translation": "(for the) repelling"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(by) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسَ", "translation": "[the] people "}, {"text": "بَعْضَهُم", "translation": "some of them"}, {"text": "بِبَعْضٍۢ", "translation": "with others"}, {"text": "لَّفَسَدَتِ", "translation": "certainly (would have) corrupted"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضُ", "translation": "the Earth"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِنَّ", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "ذُو", "translation": "(is) Possessor"}, {"text": "فَضْلٍ", "translation": "(of) bounty"}, {"text": "عَلَى", "translation": "to"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ", "translation": "the worlds"}], "sahih": "So they defeated them by permission of Allāh, and David killed Goliath, and Allāh gave him the kingship and wisdom [i.e., prophethood] and taught him from that which He willed. And if it were not for Allāh checking [some] people by means of others, the earth would have been corrupted, but Allāh is the possessor of bounty for the worlds."}